\section{Detector and Synthetic Data Details}
\label{app:detector_details}

\paragraph{TF-IDF+LR detector.}
TF-IDF features (unigrams + bigrams, max 50{,}000 features, sublinear TF) fed to Logistic Regression (C\,=\,1.0, L2 penalty).
Trained on a held-out labeled split (10K documents per class).
Post-hoc temperature scaling ($T{=}0.204$) applied via held-out validation set to calibrate $q$-scores (ECE reduced from 0.12 to 0.048).

\paragraph{Synthetic data generation.}
Continuations generated with Qwen3-0.6B using nucleus sampling ($p{=}0.95$, $T{=}0.7$), max 512 tokens per continuation.
Source prompts are the first 128 tokens of randomly sampled FineWeb documents.
Injected at token-level ratio $\rho$ via uniform random mixing across the training corpus.

